      "execution": {
        "startingPosition": "Stand with the bar in the front rack, use an overhand grip at a comfortable width, and support yourself on both feet.",
        "movement": "Dip quickly, extend the hips, knees, and ankles forcefully, and drive the arms to full extension while moving one foot forward and the other backward.",
        "endpoint": "Receive the bar overhead in a split stance with both elbows fully straight.",
        "returnPhase": "Recover until both feet are on one line with the bar locked out, then lower it under control to the front rack.",
